ow things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10809,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"t5xsIwoErak","position":50,"timestamp":"01:49:40","rawTrack":"Ebrahim - iHeartBabby","track":{"id":"V5fnO-3yruk","path":"/artists/ebrahim/tracks/iheartbabby/","slug":"iheartbabby","title":"iHeartBabby","artist":{"slug":"ebrahim","title":"Ebrahim"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"hA1rAvGCW2c","slug":"215","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/episode-215/ra.1080841244","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-215-beats-1-launch"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #215 (Beats 1 Launch)","artwork":"/images/episodes/215.jpg","content":"Soulection debutes on Beats 1.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7273,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-07-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"kYe-xIZUrB4","position":48,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ebrahim - iheartbobby","track":{"id":"6dQZj2UNnC0","path":"/artists/ebrahim/tracks/iheartbobby/","slug":"iheartbobby","title":"iheartbobby","artist":{"slug":"ebrahim","title":"Ebrahim"},"artwork":"images/artists/ebrahim/tracks/iheartbobby.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9kU3pne9Ev0","slug":"263","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-263/ra.1121837286","soundcloud